# Cached copies of the full aggregator index (several MB each). Kept out of
# version control because CI refreshes them every three hours and committing
# them would grow the repository by tens of megabytes a day. Losing the cache
# is safe: ingest refuses to save a registry that collapses (see
# ingest.min_retention_fraction), so a failed download fails the run loudly
# instead of silently deleting most of the catalogue.
data/sources/src-iptv-org-index-category.m3u
data/sources/src-iptv-org-index-all.m3u
